# ── Admin ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Password required by the admin panel to obtain an API token.
# Change this before deploying.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=nakur-admin

# ── Frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_API_BASE is the base URL for API calls from the React client.
# Leave empty (or unset) when deploying to Vercel — the API lives on the
# same origin and relative /api/* paths work automatically.
# In local dev the Vite proxy forwards /api → http://localhost:3001.
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:3001

# ── Serverless build ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NITRO_PRESET can override the build preset without editing package.json,
# e.g. NITRO_PRESET=vercel npm run build
# (npm run build:<platform> scripts already pass the preset explicitly.)

# ── Storage (catalogue + admin sessions) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Local/dev: filesystem under ./server/.data. The fs driver is the default.
#
# In serverless, the filesystem is ephemeral, so mount a real driver by setting
# NITRO_STORAGE_DRIVER (see nitro.config.ts) plus its credentials, or just
# point DATA_DIR at a writable tmp dir for demo purposes:
#
#   DATA_DIR=/tmp/data
#
# Examples:
#   Vercel     -> NITRO_STORAGE_DRIVER=vercel-kv   KV_REST_API_URL=...  KV_REST_API_TOKEN=...
#   Netlify    -> NITRO_STORAGE_DRIVER=netlify-blob
#   Cloudflare -> NITRO_STORAGE_DRIVER=cloudflare-kv   (plus a KV namespace binding)
#   AWS        -> NITRO_STORAGE_DRIVER=s3   AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=... AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=... AWS_REGION=...
